      "SISSY: Bud?\nSISSY: Oh. I was just leaving.\nPAM: Good.\nPAM: Funny. Very funny.",
      "PAM: Hello? Yes -- yes -- I see -- all right-- They need somebody to come and identify the body ---\nAUNT CORENE: I can't. I can't go.",
      "SISSY: You bet. I finally got exactly what I wanted. A real cowboy.\nPAM: Bud, the family car is waiting."
    ]
